    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__LookupQuery__c records missing match-field or matching-field configuration.
Why it matters: A price rule lookup with incomplete config returns no rows — the rule fires but pulls nothing, so the intended pricing logic silently does nothing. Hidden behind &quot;everything looks fine in Setup&quot;.
Suppress a finding: for placeholders mid-build.
Disable the detector: only if your rules don&apos;t use SBQQ__LookupQuery__c. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
